rgartener, but illogically I somehow think I\u2019m a grown up. Here\u2019s what I wrote on the photo: oh how my heart aches for you, little Mary. They tried to steal your body and soul, but they didn\u2019t know you\u2019d fly. There is hope, friend. #metoo https:\/\/t.co\/kFBO422Qrm","userId":16613700,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/D191xbBXgAUxKxy?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"MaryDeMuth","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":53,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1108795138183180288,"date":1553192336000,"rawContent":"Healing is a job you pursue, the longing you don\u2019t tamp down, the goal when you\u2019re mired in tears and you can\u2019t see your way to wholeness. It doesn\u2019t happen lackadaisically. Want it. Need it. Pray for it. Tell your story to safe person to initiate it. Seek counsel for it. #metoo https:\/\/t.co\/AWkgTpbv4p","userId":16613700,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/D2M7S6nXQAMIbgd?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"MaryDeMuth","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":54,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1110923592068292608,"date":1553699798000,"rawContent":"This is me when it happened. #metoo. I later wrote a letter to the boys who raped me, and today I reflect back on that letter. What I know: sexual abuse is hard to heal from, and my heart constantly grieves for those who have that story. #wetoobook https:\/\/t.co\/AQfLDWj4bL https:\/\/t.co\/RgFEDTeioi","userId":16613700,"media":["h